</a></span><br><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3) Mail 발송 시 기재사항 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">전공, 학년, 학번, 성명, 연락처</span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※&nbsp;문의처 : 취업지원본부 (054-478-7983)</span></span></span></p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
